Todo 35 filler scope check

Candidate rejected: a seventh validation Spec for `conformance/oracle-linkage`.

Reason: `spec:validation.verification-linkage` already carries the single law that declared
verification resolves through a performing trace. `checkVerifiesLinkage` and
`checkOracleLinkage` are the two realizing entrypoints for that one law. A separate oracle-only
Spec would repeat the same law and turn the validator registry into a count target.

Coverage result: the two pre-existing Specs plus the six new Specs cover all eleven registry IDs.
No additional validation carrier is needed.
